    /// What each of a circuit's lines drew over time, against its rating.
    ///
    /// Every connector on the circuit and below it, summed onto the line it is
    /// wired to, or onto every line when it is wired to none: each bucket's
    /// summed peak and mean, over the last 24 hours in five-minute buckets or
    /// the last seven days by the hour. Only current drawn while charging is
    /// counted. Requires the caller to be at least a Member of the circuit's
