    /// The energy a location took, bucket by bucket.
    ///
    /// `range` picks the window and the bucket size: `4h` in quarter hours,
    /// `24h` by the hour, `7d` and `30d` by the day. Days start at local
    /// midnight in the location's time zone (`timeZone` says which zone was
    /// used, `UTC` when the location has none). Counts every connector under
