    /// Shows what attaching or detaching policies would change, and changes nothing.
    ///
    /// Name the subject by `memberId` (a membership id) or by `principalId` (an API
    /// key's, from `GET …/api-keys`); exactly one.
    ///
    /// Every permission in the catalog is decided for the member under the bindings
    /// they hold and under the bindings they would hold, at the project and in the
    /// mode named; the two are compared. A permission that only holds when a
    /// resource is assigned to the caller (an installer's job) is held under neither,
    /// because a simulation names no resource.
