    /// What a project's sessions came to over a window, at current prices.
    ///
    /// Gross and net are separate figures and are never merged: gross is the
    /// sum of what the sessions cost under today's tariffs, per currency;
    /// net is that less the cost of the energy under each location's supply
    /// contract, for the locations that have one. Money is never summed across
    /// currencies; a session with no price is counted apart and is never a
    /// zero; a session still running is counted apart and is in no figure; and
    /// if more sessions started than one question prices, `capReached` is true
    /// and no total is given. Each location is resolved in its own time zone and
    /// every window used is listed.
    ///
