    /// The project's closed months, newest first.
    ///
    /// At most 120. Each has what the month came to, who closed it and when; the
    /// month itself is `GET /v1/projects/{projectId}/statements?month=`. A month
    /// still open is not in the list. Needs `settlement.statement.read`, which an
